---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import EditorialHero from '../components/EditorialHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Private Residences | Bauhu" description="Commission a private Bauhu residence shaped around land, view, climate and lifestyle.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main>
    <EditorialHero
      eyebrow="Private residences"
      title="A home shaped by site, climate and view."
      text="The private residence route is for clients seeking an architectural home refined around their land, lifestyle, privacy and long term resilience."
      primaryHref="/start-your-project"
      primaryLabel="Begin a private conversation"
      secondaryHref="/how-it-works"
      secondaryLabel="How it works"
    />
    <section class="section-pad bg-paper">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-site">
        <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Commissioning process</p>
        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr]">
          <h2 class="font-display text-4xl leading-tight md:text-6xl">Designed with architectural calm, built with engineered certainty.</h2>
          <div class="space-y-7 text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">
            <p>A Bauhu residence begins with the land. Access, exposure, view, shade, privacy, planning position and local construction conditions are considered before the home is drawn in detail.</p>
            <p>This is a private architectural route, but it is not an open ended experiment. The design is supported by Bauhu building system logic, helping reduce uncertainty on remote and coastal sites.</p>
            <p>The result is a residence that feels settled in its place while benefiting from controlled manufacture, steel frame precision and a clear route to delivery.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad bg-mist">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-site gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="bg-paper p-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">01</p>
          <h3 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl">Site led</h3>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-ink/70">Each residence responds to the plot, orientation, weather, approach and the way the client wants to live.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-paper p-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">02</p>
          <h3 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl">Architectural</h3>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-ink/70">The emphasis is on proportion, shade, terraces, outlook, material character and a calm relationship with the landscape.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-paper p-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">03</p>
          <h3 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl">Buildable</h3>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-ink/70">Design decisions are made with manufacture, shipping, structure and local completion in mind from the outset.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
